{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pungo",
    "steam_appid": 3603010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/815a2143d4c1fa940c0398fa0af231b0.avif?t=1753672625\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pungo</strong> is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats, original power-ups, and innovative levels full of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kitten has its own mix of abilities, unique stats, and distinct playstyles \u2014 try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-flop, or kick to charge energy and unleash super moves to dominate the field! Be the fastest kitten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends, organize tournaments, and become the most victorious cat. Scratch mystery boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable world of <strong>Pungo</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/815a2143d4c1fa940c0398fa0af231b0.avif?t=1753672625\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pungo</strong> is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats, original power-ups, and innovative levels full of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kitten has its own mix of abilities, unique stats, and distinct playstyles \u2014 try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-flop, or kick to charge energy and unleash super moves to dominate the field! Be the fastest kitten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends, organize tournaments, and become the most victorious cat. Scratch mystery boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable world of <strong>Pungo</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Two cats, a ball of yarn, and a duel full of reflexes and fun. Play against a friend or solo, use surprising power-ups, and unlock adorable kittens. Will you be the most agile on the field? Catch the yarn ball and show off your skills in Pungo!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
